  .wp-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0;
    color: #fff;
    letter-spacing: normal;
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-family: 'Liu Jian Mao Cao', 'Xingkai SC', 'STXingkai', 'HanziPen SC', 'Kaiti SC', 'STKaiti', 'KaiTi', '楷体', cursive;
    text-wrap: balance;
    word-break: keep-all;
    /* 底色提亮之后，给书法笔画补一条「贴着笔画的窄暗边」保证分离度。
